// Placeholder. noctalia regenerates this file with the live matugen palette
// whenever the theme changes, and chezmoi's `create_` attribute means this
// content is written ONLY when the file is missing -- it is never overwritten,
// so noctalia's generated colors always survive `chezmoi apply`.
//
// It exists at all because config.kdl `include`s it, and niri aborts its whole
// config on a missing include. Before this, a fresh machine got a config.kdl
// pointing at a file that was never created.
